            0.165,
            0.276,
            0.753,
            0.301
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1.4 Relations among Number Sequences"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.315,
            0.884,
            0.36
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Sometimes, number sequences can be related to each other in surprising ways."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.369,
            0.861,
            0.391
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ": What happens when we start adding up odd numbers?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.332,
            0.397,
            0.389,
            0.417
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_5_equation_13.jpg",
          "content": "1 = 1"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.331,
            0.42,
            0.427,
            0.44
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_5_equation_14.jpg",
          "content": "1 + 3 = 4"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.332,
            0.442,
            0.463,
            0.462
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_5_equation_15.jpg",
          "content": "1+3+5=9"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.332,
            0.465,
            0.513,
            0.485
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_5_equation_16.jpg",
          "content": "1+3+5+7=16"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.332,
            0.488,
            0.547,
            0.508
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_5_equation_17.jpg",
          "content": "1+3+5+7+9=25"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.332,
            0.51,
            0.597,
            0.532
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_5_equation_18.jpg",
          "content": "1+3+5+7+9+11=36"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.557,
            0.521,
            0.579
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "This is a really beautiful pattern!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.589,
            0.841,
            0.613
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Why does this happen? Do you think it will happen forever?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.621,
            0.885,
            0.69
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The answer is that the pattern does happen forever. But why? As mentioned earlier, the reason why the pattern happens is just as important and exciting as the pattern itself."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.701,
            0.437,
            0.723
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A picture can explain it"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.729,
            0.885,
            0.797
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Visualising with a picture can help explain the phenomenon. Recall that square numbers are made by counting the number of dots in a square grid."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 24,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.803,
            0.817,
            0.848
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "How can we partition the dots in a square grid into odd numbers of dots: 1, 3, 5, 7,... ?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 25,
          "bbox": [
            0.194,
            0.858,
            0.764,
            0.881
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Think about it for a moment before reading further!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
